### List workshops
GET http://localhost:5000/api/workshops?page=1&limit=10

### Search workshops
GET http://localhost:5000/api/workshops?q=Silent

### Get one
GET http://localhost:5000/api/workshops/workshops-1

### Create (admin token)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/workshops
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "City of Lights Workshop",
  "host": "CodeCamp",
  "mode": "In-person",
  "date": "2026-12-08",
  "price": 249
}
